    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύ̆βᾰλ-ον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dung, excrement</i>, <i><span class="en">
